# Earth base, keep_pointer on: park the pointer, start Advance Time, end it with a click. Measured pointer: docs/hacks.md.
until colours 16
wait 50
click
until colours 4
wait 20
key 1
# The data-disk prompt prints a character at a time; a key before it finishes is ignored.
wait 400
disk df0 disk2
wait 20
key space
until colours 18 6000
wait 100
hack keep_pointer on
click 28 10
wait 60
click
wait 10
quit
